# Mutation plan for the licensed half of the CPA routes (D-300), 2026-09-13.
#
#   scripts/mutate-batch.sh scripts/mutations/cpa-licensed.plan
#
# The api lines run against the licensed pair (`cpa_licensed`) or the unlicensed one
# (`custom_profile_attributes`); the unit lines against `property_hooks`. The decisions a reader
# gets wrong: whether the licence hook fires on a create, the attr defaults and clearing, the
# field-limit comparison, the human/owner rule, the sync-lock direction, the shared_only
# intersection and the rank clamp direction, the type-change cleanup's exception, the default
# permission level, the two patch-permission branches, the source_only option hiding and the
# per-field value permission. The last two lines are the no-op controls and must SURVIVE.
